} \\\\  & ={e}^{t}\\sqrt{{cos}^{2}⁡t-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t+2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t} \\\\  & ={e}^{t}\\sqrt{2({cos}^{2}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t)} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}{e}^{t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the arc length of the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\sqrt{2}{e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}{e}^{t}\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}({e}^{\\pi /2}-{e}^{0}) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}({e}^{\\pi /2}-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330052 13194139535078 true] [17592186330051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330053 13194139535078 true] [17592186330051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330054 13194139535078 true] [17592186330051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330055 13194139535078 true] [17592186330051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330056 13194139535078 true] [17592186330051 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535078 true] [17592186330051 1041 "selection" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330051 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330055 13194139535078 true] [17592186330051 1110 #uuid "662f2f2b-9e63-53a0-acac-fbeeeddf9d25" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330052 1034 "\\sqrt{2}{e}^{\\pi /2}" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330052 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535078 true] [17592186330052 1111 #uuid "1191db6c-09ca-5e01-9129-050a63648dbd" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330053 1034 "\\sqrt{2}{e}^{\\pi }-1" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330053 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535078 true] [17592186330053 1111 #uuid "75a005ca-6f70-5830-acaf-5ff9cbc7f017" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330054 1034 "2{e}^{\\pi /2}" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330054 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535078 true] [17592186330054 1111 #uuid "b9cc2330-9cd2-5d53-b054-0f32f557c8dd" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330055 1034 "\\sqrt{2}({e}^{\\pi /2}-1)" 13194139535078 true] [17592186