nd the arc length of the curve $r(t)=⟨{t}^{2},\\,4,\\,{t}^{2}⟩$\nfrom  $t=0$ to $t=2.$" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330064 1113 #uuid "23862600-8c37-5abe-8c3d-0dc47feee1b3" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330064 1145 "First, we find ${r}^{′}(t)$ and $‖{r}^{′}(t)‖:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2t,\\,0,\\,2t⟩ \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(2t)}^{2}+0+{(2t)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{8{t}^{2}} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{2}\\,t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that $t\\ge 0$ for $t\\in [0,2].$\n\nTherefore, the arc length of the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}2\\sqrt{2}t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}({t}^{2}){|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =4\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330065 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330066 13194139535078 true] [17592186330065 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330067 13194139535078 true] [17592186330065 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330068 13194139535078 true] [17592186330065 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330069 13194139535078 true] [17592186330065 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330070 13194139535078 true] [17592186330065 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535078 true] [17592186330065 1041 "selection" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330065 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330066 13194139535078 true] [17592186330065 1110 #uuid "e5acc5f4-e4cb-5ddd-9fc2-1da017060484" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330066 1034 "4\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330066 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535078 true] [17592186330066 1111 #uuid "53517ea3-26c4-5902-be5e-7023b9c68892" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330067 1034 "16" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330067 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535078 true] [17592186330067 1111 #uuid "a43dd25b-f9c5-5b3c-bc3a-355433d5b591" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330068 1034 "8" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330068 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535078 true] 