\\text{d}t}(2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,\\,3t,\\,4t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩ \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(-4t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t)}^{2}+(3t)^{2}+{(4t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16{t}^{2}{sin}^{2}⁡2t+9{t}^{2}+16{t}^{2}{cos}^{2}⁡2t} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16{t}^{2}+9{t}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25{t}^{2}} \\\\  & =5t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that $t\\ge 0$ for $t\\in [0,2].$\n\nTherefore, the arc length of the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}5t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={(\\frac{5{t}^{2}}{2})|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =10.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330079 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330080 13194139535078 true] [17592186330079 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330081 13194139535078 true] [17592186330079 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330082 13194139535078 true] [17592186330079 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330083 13194139535078 true] [17592186330079 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330084 13194139535078 true] [17592186330079 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535078 true] [17592186330079 1041 "selection" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330079 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330081 13194139535078 true] [17592186330079 1110 #uuid "3670a8d8-8690-5738-a2b3-cb0bb5b0a50c" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330080 1034 "20" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330080 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535078 true] [17592186330080 1111 #uuid "104f25b4-0991-5fa2-a86e-714183a38770" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330081 1034 "10" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330081 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535078 true] [17592186330081 1111 #uuid "137cc6ce-1302-55b8-93da-b31da784beb6" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330082 1034 "6" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330082 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535078 true] [17592186330082 1111 #uuid "612599a2-0d24-5584-8ec9-03156e2ea4e7" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330083 1034 "18" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330083 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 1319413953