 "02904945-e53d-5a5a-8b80-5ae0efb5f8d8" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330106 1145 "First, we find ${r}^{′}(t)$ and $‖{r}^{′}(t)‖:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t+2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t-2t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t\\,,4t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t⟩ \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(4t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t)}^{2}+{(4t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16{t}^{2}{cos}^{2}⁡t+16{t}^{2}{sin}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16{t}^{2}} \\\\  & =4t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that $t>0$ for $t\\in [1,2].$\n\nTherefore, the arc length of the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}4t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2{t}^{2}{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =2(4-1) \\\\  & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330107 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330108 13194139535078 true] [17592186330107 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330109 13194139535078 true] [17592186330107 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330110 13194139535078 true] [17592186330107 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330111 13194139535078 true] [17592186330107 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330112 13194139535078 true] [17592186330107 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535078 true] [17592186330107 1041 "selection" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330107 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330112 13194139535078 true] [17592186330107 1110 #uuid "6ddaa2dc-72c3-542f-b301-04ce5fa97c4d" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330108 1034 "9" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330108 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535078 true] [17592186330108 1111 #uuid "8dc5d1c1-2837-56b3-a302-3c40a0d6d9f6" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330109 1034 "10" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330109 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535078 true] [17592186330109 1111 #uuid "315b78a7-a9f4-56a3-bbaa-a33dcb4a81ff" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330110 1034 "8" 13194139535078 true] [17592186330110 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 1319413953